<section class="section-pad container" id="whatsapp-generator"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">FROM A CLICK TO A CONVERSATION</span><h2>Create your WhatsApp contact link</h2><p>Let customers message your business without saving your number first. Add your country code and an optional opening message, then copy the link into your website, social bio or email signature.</p></div><div class="grid grid-2"><form id="whatsapp-form" class="card stack"><label>WhatsApp number with country code<input name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="+91 8368487667" maxlength="30" required></label><label>Pre-filled message (optional)<textarea name="message" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Hello, I would like to know more about your services."></textarea></label><button class="button">Generate WhatsApp link</button><p id="whatsapp-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div data-demo-quota="whatsapp" class="demo-quota" aria-live="polite">Three free tries, then log in to continue.</div></form><div class="card"><h3>Your business is one tap away</h3><p>Use a number registered with WhatsApp. The message opens in the visitor’s WhatsApp app; it is sent only when they choose to send it.</p><div id="whatsapp-result" hidden><label>Your shareable link<input id="whatsapp-output" type="text" readonly></label><div class="row"><button type="button" id="whatsapp-copy" class="button">Copy link</button><a id="whatsapp-open" class="button secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Test link</a></div></div><p class="small">Your number and message stay in your browser until you open or share the link. Generating a link does not send a message.</p></div></div></section><script src="<?=url('/assets/js/whatsapp-generator.js')?>" defer></script>
